<view class="agreement-root">
  <view class="memo-nav" style="height: {{navHeight}}px; padding-top: {{statusBarHeight}}px;">
    <view class="memo-nav-inner agreement-nav-inner" style="height: {{navContentHeight}}px; padding-right: {{navRightPadding}}px;">
      <view class="memo-back-button" bindtap="goBack" hover-class="memo-back-pressed" aria-label="返回">
        <view class="memo-back-icon"></view>
      </view>
      <text class="memo-nav-title">用户协议</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="agreement-page" style="padding-top: {{navHeight}}px;">
    <view class="agreement-content">
      <view class="agreement-hero page-enter">
        <text class="agreement-kicker">MEMOGRAD · SERVICE TERMS</text>
        <text class="agreement-title">用户协议</text>
        <text class="agreement-desc">请在使用 MemoGrad 学习、刷题、错题整理与导入服务前阅读以下说明。</text>
        <view class="hero-meta">
          <view class="hero-meta-dot"></view>
          <text>使用服务即表示您理解并接受本协议</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="article-card page-enter delay-one">
        <view class="article-intro">
          <text class="article-intro-label">READING GUIDE</text>
          <text class="article-intro-text">本协议说明 MemoGrad 的服务范围、使用规范与责任边界。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">01</text>
            <text class="section-title">服务内容</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">本小程序提供学习、刷题、错题整理与内容辅助服务。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">02</text>
            <text class="section-title">使用规范</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">用户应遵守法律法规及平台规范，不得提交违法、侵权或其他不当内容。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">03</text>
            <text class="section-title">内容审核与准确性</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">平台会对导入内容和学习内容进行必要的审核与处理，但不保证所有内容都完全准确。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">04</text>
            <text class="section-title">结果仅供参考</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">因学习内容、题目解析或系统提示产生的结果，仅供参考。</text>
        </view>

        <view class="article-section">
          <view class="section-head">
            <text class="section-index">05</text>
            <text class="section-title">账号责任</text>
          </view>
          <text class="article-copy">账号由微信身份标识关联，用户应对本人账号使用行为负责。</text>
        </view>
      </view>

      <view class="agreement-end page-enter delay-two">
        <view class="agreement-end-line"></view>
        <text>MEMOGRAD · STUDY WITH CLARITY</text>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
